cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Cambodian Civil Judgment Case Briefs
message: >-
  These are machine-generated research notes, not legal advice and not a source of law.
  Cite the underlying judgment alongside any brief.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Chanvireak
    given-names: Seng
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  108 AI-generated five-point case briefs of Cambodian civil judgments (2015-2020),
  each with machine-checked sentence-level pin cites and a disclosed-defects note,
  plus a cross-case digest of the doctrine the corpus applies.
